{'symbol': 'BEN', 'date': '2022-12-13 16:30:00', 'title': 'FRANKLIN RESOURCES, INC. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'SAN MATEO, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--FRANKLIN RESOURCES, INC. (THE “COMPANY”) [NYSE:BEN] ANNOUNCED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND IN THE AMOUNT OF $0.30 PER SHARE PAYABLE ON JANUARY 13, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD HOLDING SHARES OF COMMON STOCK AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 30, 2022. THE QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.30 PER SHARE REPRESENTS A 3.4% INCREASE OVER THE DIVIDENDS PAID FOR THE PRIOR QUARTER AND THE SAME QUARTER LAST YEAR. THE COMPANY HAS RAISED ITS DIVIDEND EVERY YEAR SINCE 1981.'}